              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Spring Framework comes with a Kotlin router DSL available in 3 flavors:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "WebMvc.fn DSL"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc-functional.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " with "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "router { }"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/kdoc-api/spring-webmvc/org.springframework.web.servlet.function/router.html"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "WebFlux.fn Reactive DSL"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webflux-functional.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " with "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "router { }"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/kdoc-api/spring-webflux/org.springframework.web.reactive.function.server/router.html"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "WebFlux.fn Coroutines DSL"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "languages/kotlin/coroutines.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " with "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "coRouter { }"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/kdoc-api/spring-webflux/org.springframework.web.reactive.function.server/co-router.html"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "These DSL let you write clean and idiomatic Kotlin code to build a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "RouterFunction"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " instance as the following example shows:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Configuration\nclass RouterRouterConfiguration {\n\n\t@Bean\n\tfun mainRouter(userHandler: UserHandler) = router {\n\t\taccept(TEXT_HTML).nest {\n\t\t\tGET(\"/\") { ok().render(\"index\") }\n\t\t\tGET(\"/sse\") { ok().render(\"sse\") }\n\t\t\tGET(\"/users\", userHandler::findAllView)\n\t\t}\n\t\t\"/api\".nest {\n\t\t\taccept(APPLICATION_JSON).nest {\n\t\t\t\tGET(\"/users\", userHandler::findAll)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\taccept(TEXT_EVENT_STREAM).nest {\n\t\t\t\tGET(\"/users\", userHandler::stream)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tresources(\"/**\", ClassPathResource(\"static/\"))\n\t}\n}"
              }
            ],
            "language": "kotlin",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This DSL is programmatic, meaning that it allows custom registration logic of beans through an "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "if"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " expression, a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "for"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " loop, or any other Kotlin constructs. That can be useful when you need to register routes depending on dynamic data (for example, from a database)."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "note"
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "See "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "MiXiT project"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/mixitconf/mixit/"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for a concrete example."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "router-dsl",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Router DSL"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A Kotlin DSL is provided via "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "MockMvc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Kotlin extensions in order to provide a more idiomatic Kotlin API and to allow better discoverability (no usage of static methods)."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "val mockMvc: MockMvc = ...\nmockMvc.get(\"/person/{name}\", \"Lee\") {\n\tsecure = true\n\taccept = APPLICATION_JSON\n\theaders {\n\t\tcontentLanguage = Locale.FRANCE\n\t}\n\tprincipal = Principal { \"foo\" }\n}.andExpect {\n\tstatus { isOk }\n\tcontent { contentType(APPLICATION_JSON) }\n\tjsonPath(\"$.name\") { value(\"Lee\") }\n\tcontent { json(\"\"\"{\"someBoolean\": false}\"\"\", false) }\n}.andDo {\n\tprint()\n}"
              }
            ],
            "language": "kotlin",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "mockmvc-dsl",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "MockMvc DSL"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Spring Framework provides a "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "ScriptTemplateView"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/view/script/ScriptTemplateView.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " which supports "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "JSR-223"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://www.jcp.org/en/jsr/detail?id=223"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to render templates by using script engines."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "By leveraging "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "scripting-jsr223"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " dependencies, it is possible to use such feature to render Kotlin-based templates with "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "kotlinx.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " DSL or Kotlin multiline interpolated "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "String"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "build.gradle.kts"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "dependencies {\n        runtime(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-scripting-jsr223:${kotlinVersion}\")\n}"
              }
            ],
            "language": "kotlin",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Configuration is usually done with "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ScriptTemplateConfigurer"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ScriptTemplateViewResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " beans."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "KotlinScriptConfiguration.kt"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Configuration\nclass KotlinScriptConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n\tfun kotlinScriptConfigurer() = ScriptTemplateConfigurer().apply {\n\t\tengineName = \"kotlin\"\n\t\tsetScripts(\"scripts/render.kts\")\n\t\trenderFunction = \"render\"\n\t\tisSharedEngine = false\n\t}\n\n    @Bean\n    fun kotlinScriptViewResolver() = ScriptTemplateViewResolver().apply {\n        setPrefix(\"templates/\")\n        setSuffix(\".kts\")\n    }\n}"
              }
            ],
            "language": "kotlin",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "See the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "kotlin-script-templating"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/sdeleuze/kotlin-script-templating"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " example project for more details."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "kotlin-script-templates",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Kotlin Script Templates"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Kotlin multiplatform serialization"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is supported in Spring MVC, Spring WebFlux and Spring Messaging (RSocket). The builtin support currently targets CBOR, JSON, and ProtoBuf formats."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "To enable it, follow "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "those instructions"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization#setup"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to add the related dependency and plugin. With Spring MVC and WebFlux, both Kotlin serialization and Jackson will be configured by default if they are in the classpath since Kotlin serialization is designed to serialize only Kotlin classes annotated with "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@Serializable"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". With Spring Messaging (RSocket), make sure that neither Jackson, GSON or JSONB are in the classpath if you want automatic configuration, if Jackson is needed configure "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "KotlinSerializationJsonMessageConverter"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " manually."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "kotlin-multiplatform-serialization",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Kotlin multiplatform serialization"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
    "title": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Web"
      }
    ]
  }
